WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.998
If the constraint crosses account selection, deal strategy, operating execution, and leadership capacity, a single session will not solve it.

00:00:07.998 --> 00:00:14.797
The Ninety-Day Revenue Activation is the complete engagement for a material revenue result that requires coordinated execution.

00:00:14.797 --> 00:00:21.195
We define the result, diagnose the constraint, activate the work, and prove movement over ninety days.

00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:27.594
The engagement may combine timing and account selection, enterprise opportunity strategy, operating execution, and specialist support.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:33.193
The scope is determined by the result, not by a menu of disconnected activity.

00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:36.392
The proof standard is agreed before work begins.

00:00:36.392 --> 00:00:47.590
It may be a qualified opportunity opened, a strategic deal advanced, an expansion path created, a new buying group reached, or leadership capacity returned while revenue execution improves.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:55.538
If the result is material, measurable, and must move this quarter, book a qualified fifteen-minute conversation and bring the outcome.
